==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
From {{gen}} {{plural}} of ''[[ferð]]'' "[[trip]]" or "[[voyage]]" (''[[ferða]]'' meaning "of trips" or "of voyages") + ''[[taska]]'' "[[bag]]". Literally meaning "bag of trips" or "bag of voyages".

===Noun===
'''ferðataska''' {{f}}

# [[suitcase]]

